html.gadget/HTML_GetClass                            html.gadget/HTML_GetClass

   NAME
    HTML_GetClass -- get a pointer to the html.gadget class (V1)

   SYNOPSIS
    class = HTML_GetClass();
    D0

    Class *HTML_GetClass(VOID);

   FUNCTION
    Returns the class pointer for NewObject(). The class is public as well,
    so after OpenLibrary() NewObject(NULL, "html.gadget", ...) works too.

   RESULT
    class - pointer to the class, never NULL while the library is open.
